{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"states\": [\n    {\n      \"shot\": 1,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他明知道回去未必能找回曾经的亲近，还是忍不住抱着希望，但眼下似乎决定不再执着回头，先把日子过好。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"舍不得、犹豫、眷恋、抱有希望\",\n      \"missed\": \"他不愿仅凭一点希望就回去忍让；以后独自承担事情时仍然害怕、没有底气，但不愿因此收回向前走的打算。下方低音、重和弦与试探步伐的具体对应，需要逐句读才能理解。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 2,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他还没有完全放下回头找回亲近的念头，但正在尝试不再被这份念头牵着走，选择继续过好眼下的生活。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"眷恋、不甘、犹豫、不安\",\n      \"missed\": \"仍怕、仍没底与不愿撤回决定之间的关系不容易一眼读出；左侧线条逐渐聚起、右侧多条金色线条持续起伏，也不能直接让人看出人物正在克服恐惧向前走。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 3,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他虽然还舍不得过去，也害怕未来独自承担一切，但已经决定不再因为害怕而停下脚步。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"留恋、害怕、犹豫、试着坚定\",\n      \"missed\": \"最关键的转折是害怕并没有消失，但他已经开始行动；这层意思在最后一句才明确出现。前面关于低音、和弦、步子试探和逐渐聚拢的几层画面，需要连续阅读才能串成一个过程。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    }\n  ],\n  \"score\": 3,\n  \"link\": 3,\n  \"main_problem\": \"主文虽然字号大、对比强，但把回头的念想、现实中的选择、对未来的害怕、音乐意象和向前行动全部放在同一个长段落里，缺少明确的视觉主次。第一眼容易先抓到舍不得回头的念想，却不一定能抓到真正重要的转折：他仍然害怕，但已经决定往前走。下方金色动画有视觉变化，却不能独立说明这些变化与人物处境的对应关系。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "cf55d313-aa60-4be6-8bc3-3bde5c6d6895", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T010407130938Z", "elapsed_seconds": 80.922, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T01:05:28.054986+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "138deb0b9eb89ed699066d6e06f395a9b5ea421fda14de52446b68f660e248a9", "attachment_count": 3}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 3, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T010407130938Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "33ec50b5d45d8e4fa7c3e32d04e3464211e0f7a1f37698071cf36fc09ab3b1ac"}}}
